    "subject": "Postgres Connection Settings",
    "trigger": "a caller reads ConnectionDescription when no description is cached (none computed yet, or the cache was cleared by SetAmbientConfiguration, by a PropertyChanged on the configuration's own local properties, or by a PropertyChanged on a currently supplied inherited level)",
    "response": "resolve Database and Host through the Configuration hierarchy in the order global, shard set, read/write, shard, then local, letting a level override only when its value is neither null nor empty, then cache and return \"database {Database} on server {Host}\""
